{"name": "Labyrinth Trailblazer", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Turn-based Dungeon Crawler Rogue-like with strategic combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Navigate through a randomly generated labyrinth and encounter a variety of enemies and events. Build your party with different skills and equipments to defeat strong enemies and to conquer the dungeon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Labyrinth Trailblazer takes traditional Dungeon Crawler and streamlines it for a more roguelike approach making it easier to pick up and play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Gameplay</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">First person dungeon crawler</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020150/extras/b9a0f35ea4a1623006d416d07bbc78cf.poster.avif?t=1782786167\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020150/extras/b9a0f35ea4a1623006d416d07bbc78cf.webm?t=1782786167\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020150/extras/b9a0f35ea4a1623006d416d07bbc78cf.mp4?t=1782786167\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Turn based party combat: Characters and enemies will take one turn each before they can act again.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Shows the outcome of your actions in complex scenarios.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020150/extras/7f13b916d33297f0a8a06b8b7650528d.poster.avif?t=1782786167\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020150/extras/7f13b916d33297f0a8a06b8b7650528d.webm?t=1782786167\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020150/extras/7f13b916d33297f0a8a06b8b7650528d.mp4?t=1782786167\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Prediction system that displays enemy intents</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020150/extras/8fc974c4f02fa79ebf94fbfeff0a8fff.poster.avif?t=1782786167\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020150/extras/8fc974c4f02fa79ebf94fbfeff0a8fff.webm?t=1782786167\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020150/extras/8fc974c4f02fa79ebf94fbfeff0a8fff.mp4?t=1782786167\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Learn or upgrade skills after every fight</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020150/extras/c4d05bf664f1b0c3eafbbdb14ba20f82.poster.avif?t=1782786167\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020150/extras/c4d05bf664f1b0c3eafbbdb14ba20f82.webm?t=1782786167\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020150/extras/c4d05bf664f1b0c3eafbbdb14ba20f82.mp4?t=1782786167\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Recruit new party members and heal your party at campfire</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Encounter events</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020150/extras/30a374168ad158a92f03c6caf763c881.poster.avif?t=1782786167\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020150/extras/30a374168ad158a92f03c6caf763c881.webm?t=1782786167\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020150/extras/30a374168ad158a92f03c6caf763c881.mp4?t=1782786167\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Add markers for points of interest on your map</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020150/extras/ec94271b70c62213c91f2946ed72b32d.poster.avif?t=1782786167\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020150/extras/ec94271b70c62213c91f2946ed72b32d.webm?t=1782786167\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020150/extras/ec94271b70c62213c91f2946ed72b32d.mp4?t=1782786167\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Roguelike: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You grow strong very quickly but if you are defeated, you will need to restart from the beginning. It is quick to start another run and try again with a new strategy.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">10+ playable characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">30+ animated monsters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3 areas with different themes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">20+ items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">15+ events</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Difficulty modifier to change the way the game is played</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Procedurally generated dungeon</p></li></ul> </div>", "short_desc": "Turn-based Dungeon Crawler Rogue-like with strategic combat. Navigate through a randomly generated labyrinth and encounter a variety of enemies and events. Build your party with different skills and equipments to defeat strong enemies and to conquer the dungeon.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020150/6c06b48ad76a1d93a825617f27b44d9fd191ccd8/header.jpg?t=1782786167", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Dungeon Crawler", "Roguelike", "Turn-Based Strategy", "RPG", "Party-Based RPG", "Turn-Based Combat"], "developers": "Chris D", "publishers": "Chris D", "release_date": "Mar 9, 2026", "price": "$9.99", "appid": "4020150", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "9 March 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/WkPTo_sV8mU", "first_seen": 1773010800.0, "review_rank": 1037}